#: ../../source/guide/advanced_structures/disjoint_set.rst:14
#: 59e929e5b26c43e18077cee6f6962576
msgid ""
"The Disjoint Set data structure, also known as **Union-Find** or **Merge-"
"Find Set**, is a fundamental structure for managing partitions of "
"elements into disjoint subsets. It efficiently supports two primary "
"operations: uniting sets and finding which set an element belongs to."
msgstr ""

